        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gary Kelly, Skip Hollandsworth\n- Organizations: Fort Worth Star-Telegram, NBC\n- Products: Texas Monthly, Love's Deadly Triangle: The Texas Cadet Murder, The Killer Cadets\n- Places: Downtown Austin, Texas\n\nFacts:\n- Texas Monthly is a monthly American magazine headquartered in Downtown Austin, Texas.\n- Gary Kelly is an openly gay man who works as a film critic and journalist for Fort Worth Star-Telegram and Texas Monthly.\n- Skip Hollandsworth wrote The Killer Cadets as an article in Texas Monthly.\n- Love's Deadly Triangle: The Texas Cadet Murder was adapted from The Killer Cadets and aired on NBC.",
